App libraries for Studio, Meetings and Live Translate

The desktop app uses, among others: Symphonia (audio decoding, MPL-2.0,
https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia), used unmodified as a library; hound (WAV, Apache-2.0);
rrule and chrono-tz (repeating calendar events and time zones, MIT OR Apache-2.0); tungstenite
(WebSocket, MIT OR Apache-2.0); base64 (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Their full license texts ship
with their source on crates.io.

