Meeting-app logos

assets/apps holds the logos of Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, Slack, Discord, WhatsApp,
Telegram and Google Calendar from gilbarbara/logos (CC0-1.0), and of OBS Studio and Webex
from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0). They are trademarks of their owners, shown only to say which
apps work with Hush AI Microphone. See assets/apps/README.md.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google Gemini Live Translate

Live Translate sends the user's voice to Google's gemini-3.5-live-translate-preview model
through the Gemini API, with the user's own API key, only while it is on. Google's terms
and pricing apply (https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms). Hush AI is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Google.

